{"id":"vod_bf_39648","vodId":"39648","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"星际牛仔","name_cn":"星际牛仔","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-40/6270d6ebbc03baca02484234488e6a2a.jpg"},"summary":"2071年，随着超光速航行技术的实现，人类得以在太阳系范围内方便的移动，但是由于设计上的失误，这种技术引发了月球的爆炸，无数的月球碎片被吸引向地球，造成了空前绝后的大灾难。存活下来的人类逃离地球，并开始在太阳系各地建立家园。由于这次灾难，国家政府等权利机构都极为不稳定、治安问题也成为了一个难题。有些组织开始允许个人抓捕通缉的罪犯并换取奖金，这就是“赏金猎人”。史派克和杰特是驾驶飞船BEBOP号在宇宙中以捉拿逃犯获取奖金为生的赏金猎人。两人在星际间的旅程中，结识了身负巨债、嗜财如命的美女菲和电脑神童艾德，并收养了拥有高智商的数据狗爱因。从此，四人一狗游荡在广阔之宇宙之中，在自己与他人的生活中经历著种种悲欢离合，也寻找著各自的过去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,动画,犯罪,西部"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:56:41","classic":true,"classicRank":12,"franchise":"星际牛仔","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/xingjiniuzi/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdn